            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setup failed. Check Screen Time access, app selection, relay address and pairing code, then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定失敗。請確認「螢幕使用時間」權限、已選取的 App、伺服器網址與配對碼，再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
